  "html": "<section class=\"ae-section payment-pending-section\">\n<div class=\"ae-container\">\n<div class=\"ae-card ae-pay__card pending-content\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ae-pay__icon ae-pay__icon--info\"><i class=\"far fa-hourglass-half\"></i></span>\n<p class=\"ae-pay__text\">This usually takes under a minute. As soon as the payment comes through, we’ll open your order.</p>\n<dl class=\"ae-dl ae-dl--end ae-pay__facts order-info\">\n<div class=\"ae-dl__row info-row\">\n<dt class=\"info-label\">Order number</dt>\n<dd class=\"info-value ae-num\">TG_000001_26</dd>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ae-dl__row info-row\">\n<dt class=\"info-label\">Amount</dt>\n<dd class=\"info-value ae-num\">30 000 so'm</dd>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ae-dl__row info-row\">\n<dt class=\"info-label\">Payment method</dt>\n<dd class=\"info-value\">Click</dd>\n</div>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"ae-pay__live\" id=\"pending-live\" role=\"status\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ae-pay__dot\"></span><span data-pending-caption=\"\">The page checks by itself</span></p>\n<div class=\"ae-alert ae-alert--warn ae-pay__timeout\" hidden=\"\" id=\"pending-timeout\" role=\"status\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ae-alert__icon\"><i class=\"far fa-clock\"></i></span>\n<p>This is taking longer than usual. We’ll message you in the bot or by email as soon as the payment is confirmed.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ae-pay__actions\">\n<button class=\"ae-btn ae-btn--primary\" data-action=\"check-payment-status\" type=\"button\">\n<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"far fa-sync\"></i>Check now\n                    </button>\n<a class=\"ae-btn ae-btn--secondary\" href=\"/my-orders\">My orders</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
